<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <title>Your One-Time Login Code</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>Hello {{username}},</h2>
    <p>Welcome!</p>
    <p>Please use the code below to verify your email and set your password.</p>

    <p style="margin-top:20px; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold;">
        Your one-time code is: <span style="background:#f0f0f0; padding:5px 10px; border-radius:4px;">{{oneTimeCode}}</span>
    </p>

    <p>If you didn’t request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>
